Q: Where is my order?
A: You can track your order using the tracking link sent to your email.

Q: How can I cancel my order?
A: Orders can be cancelled within 24 hours of placing them.

Q: What is the return policy?
A: You can return items within 7 days of delivery if they are unused.

Q: Do you offer refunds?
A: Yes, refunds are processed within 5-7 business days after approval.

Q: How can I contact support?
A: You can contact support via email or live chat on our website.

Q: What payment methods are accepted?
A: We accept credit cards, debit cards, and online payment methods.

Q: How long does delivery take?
A: Delivery usually takes 3-5 business days depending on location.

Q: Can I change my delivery address?
A: Yes, you can update your address before the order is shipped.

Q: Do you offer international shipping?
A: Yes, we ship to selected international locations.

Q: Is cash on delivery available?
A: Yes, cash on delivery is available for selected locations.
